        <mxCell id="4" value="&lt;b&gt;CoreWeave / Lambda / Nebius / Together AI&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font color='#C4B5FD'&gt;• 10k+ GPU Clusters (H100/B200)&lt;br/&gt;• Fast RoCEv2 / InfiniBand Fabric&lt;br/&gt;• Rapid compute scaling&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b&gt;Challenge:&lt;/b&gt; Siloed network, steep egress fees, no native private path to enterprise data.&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#3B0764;strokeColor=#7C3AED;fontColor=#EDE9FE;align=left;" parent="1" vertex="1">
